function pb.evidence(Lo,Mo,No)
local Oo=type(No.nums)==iee[1950]and No.nums or{}
local Po=Lo.firstPlaced[Mo]
if not Po then
return{why=iee[2347]}
end
local Qo={}
for Ro,So in ipairs(No.buffs or{})do
Qo[So]=true
end
local function To(Uo)
if#Uo==0 then
return nil
end
table.sort(Uo)
return Uo[math.ceil(#Uo/2)]
end
if No.family==iee[2132]then
if(Lo.sales or 0)==0 then
return{why=iee[2348]}
end
local Vo,Wo
for Xo in pairs(Lo.own)do
local Yo,Zo,_o,ap,bp=0,0,0,0,0
for cp,dp in pairs(Lo.copies)do
local ep=dp.buff[Xo]or 0
if(dp.sold or 0)>0 then
if dp.id~=Mo then
ap=ap+1
end
if ep>0 then
if dp.id==Mo then
Yo=Yo+1
else
_o=_o+1
end
bp=math.max(bp,ep)
end
elseif ep>0 then
Zo=Zo+1
end
end
if Yo>0 and Zo==0 and(not Wo or Yo>Wo)then
Vo,Wo={name=Xo,other=_o,otherAfter=ap,top=bp},Yo
end
end
if not Vo then
return{why=iee[2349]}
end
local fp=(Vo.other>0 and iee[882])or(Vo.otherAfter>0 and iee[2350])or iee[2351]
return{seen=true,buff=Vo.name,who=fp,nums={stacks=(Lo.sales>1 and Vo.top>1)or nil,sales=Lo.sales},why=string.format(iee[2352],Wo,Vo.name,fp==iee[2350]and iee[2353]or iee[873])}
end
local ip=No.trigger and tostring(No.trigger):find(iee[2354],1,true)~=nil
local jp=0
for kp,lp in ipairs(Lo.casts)do
if lp.id==Mo then
jp=jp+1
end
end
if ip and jp==0 and(No.family==iee[2133]or No.family==iee[2130])then
return{why=iee[2355]}
end
if No.family==iee[2133]then
local mp,np,op
for pp,qp in pairs(Lo.own)do
if qp.first>=Po-1 and(Qo[pp]or qp.first<=Po+5 or ip)and(not ip or pb.nearCast(Lo,Mo,qp.starts)>0)then
local rp=0
for up,vp in pairs(qp.by)do
if up~=Mo then
rp=rp+vp
end
end
if rp>0 and(not mp or(Qo[pp]and not op)or((Qo[pp]or false)==(op or false)and rp>np))then
mp,np,op=pp,rp,Qo[pp]
end
end
end
if not mp then
return{why=iee[2356]}
end
return{seen=true,buff=mp,why=string.format(iee[2357],mp)}
end
if No.family==iee[2130]then
local wp,yp
for zp,Ap in pairs(Lo.foeBuffs)do
if Ap.first>=Po-1 and Ap.near>0 and(Qo[zp]or Ap.near>=0.5*Ap.n)and(not ip or pb.nearCast(Lo,Mo,Ap.onsets)>0)then
local Bp=Ap.near+(Qo[zp]and 1e6 or 0)+(ip and pb.nearCast(Lo,Mo,Ap.onsets)*1000 or 0)
if not yp or Bp>yp then
wp,yp=zp,Bp
end
end
end
if not wp then
return{why=iee[2358]}
end
local Cp=Lo.foeBuffs[wp]
local Dp={}
if#Cp.durs>=3 then
Dp.secsSeen=math.floor(To(Cp.durs)*10+0.5)/10
elseif Cp.foes>=5 then
Dp.keepSeen=true
end
if Cp.spN>=5 then
local Ep=Cp.sp/Cp.spN
if Ep<0.97 then
Dp.slowSeen=math.floor((1-Ep)*100+0.5)/100
end
end
if Oo.chance and(Lo.nearN or 0)>0 then
Dp.chanceSeen=math.floor(math.min(1,Cp.foes/Lo.nearN)*100+0.5)/100
end
Dp.bossToo=Cp.boss>0 or nil
return{seen=true,buff=wp,nums=Dp,why=string.format(iee[2359],Cp.foes,wp)}
end
if No.family==iee[2188]then
local Fp=(tonumber(Oo.below)or 0.25)+0.02
local Gp,Hp=0,0
for Ip,Jp in ipairs(Lo.deaths)do
if not Jp.boss then
Hp=Hp+1
if Jp.frac>0.04 and Jp.frac<=Fp then
Gp=Gp+1
end
end
end
if Hp<10 then
return{why=iee[2360]}
end
local Kp=Gp/Hp
if Kp<0.3 then
return{why=string.format(iee[2361],math.floor(Kp*100))}
end
return{seen=true,nums={shareSeen=math.floor(Kp*100+0.5)/100},why=string.format(iee[2362],Gp,Hp,math.floor(Fp*100))}
end
if No.family==iee[2036]then
local Lp={}
for Mp,Np in ipairs(Lo.summons)do
if Np.owner==Mo then
table.insert(Lp,Np)
end
end
if#Lp<2 then
return{why=iee[2363]}
end
table.sort(Lp,function(Op,Pp)
return Op.born<Pp.born
end)
local Qp,Rp,Sp={},{},{}
for Tp=2,#Lp do
local Vp=(Lp[Tp].tk or 0)-(Lp[Tp-1].tk or 0)
if Vp>0 then
table.insert(Qp,Vp)
end
end
for Wp,Xp in ipairs(Lp)do
if Xp.died then
table.insert(Rp,Xp.died-Xp.born)
end
table.insert(Sp,{Xp.born,1})
table.insert(Sp,{Xp.died or Xp.last or Xp.born,-1})
end
table.sort(Sp,function(Yp,Zp)
return Yp[1]<Zp[1]
end)
local _p,aq=0,0
for bq,cq in ipairs(Sp)do
_p=_p+cq[2]
aq=math.max(aq,_p)
end
local dq=To(Rp)
return{seen=true,nums={everySeen=To(Qp),lifeSeen=dq and math.floor(dq+0.5)or nil,capSeen=aq,made= #Lp},why=string.format(iee[2364],#Lp)}
end
if No.family==iee[2134]then
local eq,fq
for gq,hq in pairs(Lo.own)do
if(hq.by[Mo]or 0)>0 and hq.first>=Po-1 and(not eq or(Qo[gq]and not Qo[eq]))then
eq,fq=gq,hq
end
end
local iq
for jq,kq in ipairs(Lo.transforms)do
if kq.from==Mo then
iq=kq.to
end
end
if not eq then
local lq,mq,nq
for oq,pq in pairs(Lo.copies)do
if pq.id==Mo or(iq and pq.id==iq)then
for qq,rq in pairs(pq.stat or{})do
if rq.hi>rq.lo and(not lq or(rq.hi-rq.lo)>(nq-mq))then
lq,mq,nq=qq,rq.lo,rq.hi
end
end
end
end
if not lq then
return{why=iee[2365]}
end
return{seen=true,nums={stat=lq,loSeen=mq,hiSeen=nq,transformTo=iq},why=string.format(iee[2366],lq,tostring(mq),tostring(nq))}
end
return{seen=true,buff=eq,nums={maxSeen=fq.max,steps= #fq.vals,transformTo=iq},why=string.format(iee[2367],eq,tostring(fq.max))}
end
if No.family==iee[2131]then
local sq,tq,uq={},{},nil
for vq,wq in ipairs(Lo.steps)do
for xq,yq in pairs(wq.reset or{})do
table.insert(sq,yq)
table.insert(tq,wq.drop)
uq=uq or xq
end
end
if#sq<3 then
return{why=iee[2368]}
end
return{seen=true,nums={atSeen=To(sq),hitSeen=To(tq),meter=uq},why=string.format(iee[2369],#sq)}
end
if No.family==iee[2100]then
return{why=iee[2370]}
end
return{why=iee[2371]}
end
function pb.learn(zq)
local Aq={}
for Bq in pairs(zq.ids or{})do
local Cq,Dq=pcall(pb.guess,Bq)
for Eq,Fq in ipairs(Cq and type(Dq)==iee[1950]and Dq or{})do
if Fq.playable and not Fq.hand then
local Gq,Hq=pcall(pb.evidence,zq,Bq,Fq)
if Gq and type(Hq)==iee[1950]and Hq.seen then
local Iq=type(P.pasBook[Bq])==iee[1950]and P.pasBook[Bq]or{}
local Jq=type(Iq[Fq.pid])==iee[1950]and Iq[Fq.pid]or nil
local Kq={}
for Lq,Mq in pairs(Fq.nums or{})do
Kq[Lq]=Mq
end
for Nq,Oq in pairs(Hq.nums or{})do
Kq[Nq]=Oq
end
local Pq=Jq~=nil and Jq.family==Fq.family and(Jq.buff==nil or Hq.buff==nil or Jq.buff==Hq.buff)
Iq[Fq.pid]={family=Fq.family,name=Fq.name,nums=Kq,buff=Hq.buff or(Jq and Jq.buff),who=Hq.who or Fq.who,trigger=Fq.trigger,keyword=Fq.keyword,sure=(Pq and(tonumber(Jq.runs)or 0)>=1)and iee[2312]or iee[2372],runs=(Pq and(tonumber(Jq.runs)or 0)or 0)+1,at=os.time(),why=Hq.why}
P.pasBook[Bq]=Iq
table.insert(Aq,{id=Bq,g=Fq,e=Iq[Fq.pid]})
elseif Gq and type(Hq)==iee[1950]then
table.insert(Aq,{id=Bq,g=Fq,miss=Hq.why})
else
table.insert(Aq,{id=Bq,g=Fq,miss=iee[2373]..tostring(Hq)})
end
end
end
end
pb._model={}
return Aq
end
function pb.unexplained(Qq,Rq)
if not(Qq and Qq.firstPlaced and Qq.firstPlaced[Rq])then
return nil
end
local Sq={}
for Tq,Uq in ipairs(Qq.learned or{})do
if Uq.id==Rq and Uq.e and Uq.e.buff then
Sq[Uq.e.buff]=true
end
end
local Vq={}
for Wq,Xq in pairs(Qq.own)do
if(Xq.by[Rq]or 0)>0 and not Sq[Wq]then
table.insert(Vq,{w=iee[2374],b=Wq,n=Xq.by[Rq],max=Xq.max})
end
end
for Yq,Zq in pairs(Qq.foeBuffs)do
if Zq.near>0 and Zq.first>=Qq.firstPlaced[Rq]-1 and not Sq[Yq]then
table.insert(Vq,{w=iee[2375],b=Yq,n=Zq.foes,max=Zq.max})
end
end
table.sort(Vq,function(_q,ar)
return _q.n>ar.n
end)
local br={}
for cr=1,math.min(6,#Vq)do
br[cr]=Vq[cr]
end
return#br>0 and br or nil
end
function pb.finish()
local dr=bb.pas
if not(dr and(dr.n or 0)>0)then
return
end
local er=pb.learn(dr)
dr.learned=er
local gr=P.trial and P.trial.study
if gr and bb.trialId then
P.pasBook[bb.trialId]=type(P.pasBook[bb.trialId])==iee[1950]and P.pasBook[bb.trialId]or{}
P.pasBook[bb.trialId]._tries=(tonumber(P.pasBook[bb.trialId]._tries)or 0)+1
end
