for AIc,BIc in ipairs(tIc)do
if(U.flat(BIc.pos)-yIc).Magnitude<=zIc then
pIc,qIc=math.min(pIc,BIc.prog),math.max(qIc,BIc.prog)
end
end
end
end
end
if qIc<=pIc then
pIc,qIc=0.75,0.98
end
local CIc=(nIc or rIc)+1
local DIc=({pIc,qIc,(pIc+qIc)/2,pIc-(qIc-pIc)/2})[CIc]
if not DIc then
